WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.790
I want to know...

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.730
about my hero.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:07.860
Oh? What brought this on?

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.540
I can't talk to my hero.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.350
Come with me, Nemo.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.940
The hero in question...

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.760
doesn't seem to exist.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:36.240
As far as I know, this library has 
records of all of the heroes.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.300
Really?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.700
Don't be discouraged.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.280
I'll investigate as much as I can.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.860
Thank you so much!

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.310
It's nothing.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:49.450
Now, it's getting late.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:50.490
Let's save that for later.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.290
Sure.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.830
It's dangerous these days, so do take care.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.020
I will!

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.810
Wasn't that, um...

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.450
Nemo, the newest of the Seven Knights.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.320
Oh, so <i>that's</i> him.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.760
Shirley.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.870
President.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:50.080
<b>Rampancy\h\h\h-Physis-</b>

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.080
Another one?

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.270
Yes. This is the fourth this week.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.610
Another member of the disciplinary committee.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.340
Any hints as to the culprit?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.010
I'm afraid not.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:58.780
I know it must be someone involved 
with Physis, but nothing more.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.160
He'll be fine now.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.540
Thank you, Ellen.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.030
Still, I don't know when he'll 
regain consciousness.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.850
There's also this.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.790
A vampire for sure, then.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.670
President, this is my responsibility.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.430
I'll find the culprit at once.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.110
Wait!

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.810
You're doing too much, Chairwoman!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.380
But Mina...

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.180
She's right, Shirley.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.920
You should rely more on your subordinates.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:37.610
You're in no position to scold people for 
not delegating to others, President.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:40.440
Th-This is completely different!

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:44.200
Nevertheless, we're running out of 
committee members who <i>can</i> act.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.540
I have to do this.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.110
Let me help, then.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.480
For what it's worth,
I'm a member of the Seven Knights.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.840
So there must be something I can do.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:57.920
No, that's...

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.960
I think that's a wonderful idea.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.110
Thank you for your aid, Nemo.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.890
Excuse me!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.110
Mr. Newest of the Seven Knights!

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.480
You're... the girl from this morning.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.490
I'm Mina of the disciplinary committee.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.600
We actually met in the library before.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.770
Oh, sorry.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.170
It's all right.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:27.400
I can't thank you enough for helping us out.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.740
We're down so many members 
of the disciplinary committee...

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:35.500
And I have my other duties, 
so it's just been nonstop...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.580
I see.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.520
So...

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.880
You're a real lifesaver!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.830
Let's work hard together!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.810
S-Sure.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.200
Well, see you later!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.300
I didn't expect you
 of all people to volunteer.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.710
I have to start getting involved sometime.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.090
That's very admirable.

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.380
It's nice to have such 
dedication in our ranks.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:06.030
To be honest, we're hurting for the help.

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:10.030
I want to be of more use to Faria.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.200
Is that really all it is?

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.690
What?

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.540
I've been meaning to ask...

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.040
Are you hiding something?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.800
What makes you think so?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.550
Because you don't 
seem to know anything.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:32.310
About this school. About the Seven Knights.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.240
That's...

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:37.310
I don't know what you might be hiding,

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.060
and I don't really care.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.060
Yes...

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.300
If you're working for the greater good,

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.280
that's all that matters for now.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.340
I'm entrusting this investigation to you.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.830
Jou said I could find 
documentation on monsters here.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.980
No, you got it all wrong.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.340
Vampires aren't monsters.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.910
What, really?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.090
Like elves, beastfolk, and humans,

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.840
they're not inherently evil or anything.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.140
Let's see...

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:16.940
Is this where it would be?
Ah, here we go!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.140
Not inherently evil...

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.430
Vampires, vampires...

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:24.110
It says they can have children to propagate,

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.610
but they can also drink a
 person's blood to turn them.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.860
I wonder if that's why they're so demonized.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:34.350
Anyway, I'll lend you this book.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:37.370
By the way, it says their weakness is fire.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.160
Thanks, Claire!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.380
Don't mention it!

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.250
By the way, Nemo....

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:47.440
Um, has Gareth ever
 mentioned me by any chance?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.630
Er, I can't say I remember.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:52.100
Oh, Gareth!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:55.220
But your ice-cold heart is 
what I love most about you!

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:58.560
Oh?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.870
What's that medicine?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:07.290
It's for the hospitalized committee members.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:12.930
What's wrong?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.480
There are rumors going around.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:19.840
They're saying Chairwoman Shirley
might be the vampire.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.290
They think it's Shirley?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:26.440
All of the committee members worked 
with her shortly before they collapsed.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:28.230
So...

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.180
But it just can't be true!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.690
She's the one most affected by all this,

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:37.220
and she's the one working hardest to stop it!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.100
You really love Shirley, don't you?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.470
I may not know the whole picture,

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:47.220
but I can tell that you really want
 to do something for her.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.280
I do.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:55.740
That's why I want to help out
and stay by her side as long as I can.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:58.060
Then I'll support you.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.250
If you need anything, just ask.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.200
Then could I bug you for one little favor?

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.500
Oh, sure.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.990
There's somewhere I want to investigate.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:10.260
I haven't checked the forest 
on the campus outskirts yet.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.010
Are you okay?

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:20.060
Maybe we should have 
brought a light after all.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.530
No, that would only put us at risk
if the culprit is really out here.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.150
I'll manage.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.020
O-Okay.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:28.600
I'm sorry.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.080
I'm always sorry.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.880
Are you all right?

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.720
I'm fine.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.690
Just a bit dizzy...

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.180
You don't have to force yourself.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:03.020
If not for you, I...

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.140
Really, it's nothing.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.010
Ellen...

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.240
Who's there?!

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:20.080
You two...

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:35.970
Wait!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.220
She's the culprit!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.850
It's dangerous to go after her!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.230
I trust her!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.110
Succession!

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.540
<i>Alone again...</i>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.730
<i>And here I thought I'd finally...</i>

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:59.360
<i>One's loneliness is not
 tantamount to their nobility.</i>

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.750
Rachel!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>If you seek warmth, you must 
not fear the fire's burn.</i>

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:10.500
<i>Become the master of flames, Shirley.</i>

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:12.880
The master of flames...

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:21.760
Shirley...

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.310
Are you a vampire?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:25.910
Yes.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.310
Then the one who attacked 
the committee members...

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:29.970
Of course.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.820
Of course you'd assume that.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.570
Had I known things would turn out this way,

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:40.320
I'd have never decided
that I wanted to stay with you all!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:41.920
Succession!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.420
Get out of my way.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.330
If you don't...

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:49.780
I shall cut you down!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.260
Why?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.430
Why won't you fight back?!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.400
I don't want to fight you!

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.150
It's a little late for that!

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:24.010
We vampires are feared by humans as monsters.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:32.480
But my family wasn't hostile toward anyone.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.000
We never harmed a soul.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:39.760
And yet, one day, out of nowhere,
 they destroyed us.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.280
It was the same wherever I went.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:51.910
When they learned I was a vampire, 
they persecuted me out of fear.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.730
They tried to kill me out of fear.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:58.730
At long last, I found a measure of 
peace here at this school...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.960
But that's over now, too.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.940
Why?

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.040
Why...?

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.880
When word gets out that I'm a vampire, I...

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:11.620
The thought of my friends turning on me...

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.650
I simply can't bear it.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.210
So you're going to run away?

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.400
You could never understand!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.590
Of course not!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:25.380
But you said you wanted to stay with us!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.990
And I don't think that was a lie!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.070
Ellen understood, didn't she?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.190
Not everyone necessarily hates vampires.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:37.730
But...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:44.490
And if I don't tell anyone what I just saw,
there's no reason for you to leave.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:46.040
Isn't that right?

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.000
Why would you...

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.060
I'm just like you.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.530
I want to stay with my team.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.840
And you're an important 
part of that, Shirley.

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:02.680
Thank you.

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.040
Will Mina understand?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.600
She said she really wants to help you.

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:19.190
I'm sure she'll understand.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:21.630
I see...

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.490
What's that?

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.540
A Physis monster?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:27.400
Ellen?

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:28.990
Ellen!

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:32.580
Let's go, Shirley!

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:35.330
Very well!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:48.060
I've been waiting, Chairwoman.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.080
Oh, dear...

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.030
You brought the little tagalong.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.690
Well, so be it.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.050
You're...

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:00.770
Mina...

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.280
Ellen!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.070
Mina, what did you do to Ellen?!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:07.950
Oh, come on.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:11.120
The same thing you do, right?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.410
You're a vampire, too?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.620
Don't tell me you 
were the one behind all this.

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:20.450
You're so slow on the uptake, Chairwoman!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:24.500
After all I did to drive you
 to the brink...

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.010
Mina...

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.790
But that's one of the 
things I like about you.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:33.330
If not for my orders, 
I would've loved to play around more.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.280
What orders?

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.440
This conversation doesn't 
concern you, you know?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.520
I'm talking about orders
from Physis, our sanctuary.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:47.720
Does this mean... the remnants 
are hiding here at school?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.810
"Remnants," really?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.410
Physis was never actually wiped out.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.290
We've just been storing up our power.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:02.000
Nemo!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.400
Why?

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:13.260
Isn't it wonderful?

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:17.270
Physis uses the power of 
destruction to create monsters.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:20.140
What are you trying to do?

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:25.650
Destroy this world and create a new one.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.360
You really think you can—

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.540
Oh, we certainly can.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.850
After all, without the 
power of the Seven Knights,

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:36.080
no nation will be able
 to stand against Physis.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.760
Then we'll wreak a new world!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.510
With the God of Destruction's power,
we'll create a world

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.500
where vampires can live safely!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.830
Come on, Chairwoman, let's do it!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.510
Let's make ourselves a new homeland!

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:52.970
Homeland?

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:56.770
You've been alone for a long time too, right?

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:01.270
I'm happy to meet another of my kind.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:07.640
But I have Ellen... and my team!

00:16:08.510 --> 00:16:12.400
Why don't you just turn 
them into vampires, too?

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:16.010
I want to stay with them as they are.

00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:19.830
I realized that thanks to him...

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.770
Thanks to Nemo!

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:27.290
That so? Very well.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.290
Then I'll have to take you with me...

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.800
by force!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.000
Shirley!

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.400
Keep your eyes on the threat!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.890
Is this the best the Seven Knights can do?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.150
Enjoy a nice little nap, tagalong.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.010
I told you to take a nap!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.260
Ready to stay down yet?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.640
Goodness, where do you get that power from?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.040
Stop this.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:22.520
I don't want to hurt you, either.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:26.330
Then stop fighting and just die already!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.830
Oh? Not bad for a tagalong.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.780
I take back what I said earlier.

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:49.000
Not that it's going to save you!

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:56.000
Behold the power of Physis.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:18:01.890
You know, Chairwoman, you could become 
an even stronger vampire than me.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.610
I have no intention of becoming a monster.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:10.320
Rachel, grant me immortal power!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.730
So unreasonable.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.820
Dance, Primordial Flame!

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.970
Fire is the one thing vampires 
can't defend against.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:32.740
Gosh, I completely forgot about your hero.

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:35.210
But I'll heal soon enough.

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.370
Indeed, I don't expect this to be easy.

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:46.560
<i>That was...</i>

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.620
<i>Forge thy heart's desire</i>

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:52.920
<i>with our true power.</i>

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:56.830
My heart's desire...

00:18:58.620 --> 00:18:59.550
Shirley!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.990
Hold her in place with your flames 
for just a little longer!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.380
Do you have a plan?

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:07.130
There's something I want to try.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.000
Very well.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.940
Oh? I don't know what you're up to,

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:16.700
but do you really think I'm just 
going to let you get away with it?

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.310
Enough!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:36.440
You're too slow, Chairwoman.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:37.870
I know.

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.860
Immolate us both together, Kaiser Phoenix!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:47.370
Not even you can wield your vampire 
powers while you're on fire!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.000
Are you crazy, Chairwoman?!

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:52.760
<i>That's it. Don't be afraid.</i>

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:58.140
<i>Let your noble soul channel your 
inner fire into the Power of Agni!</i>

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.510
I won't lose in a battle of wills!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.880
Let me go! Let me go!

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:05.640
My hero, grant me power!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.980
Wh-What is that?!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.980
I've made up my mind.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.880
To protect the people important to me...

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.480
I'll end you!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.170
You can't mean to...

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.780
Nemo, finish this!

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.320
Legis Breaker!

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.720
Ch-Chairwoman...

00:20:58.750 --> 00:20:59.590
I'm sorry.

00:22:36.530 --> 00:22:37.530
Thank you.

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:42.210
I'm the one who should thank you.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:47.260
Faria saved me, so I wanted to 
save someone else the same way.

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:48.970
That's all.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:53.470
Indeed, it seems that's just
 the kind of person you are.

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:57.260
But you're definitely hiding something.

00:22:57.260 --> 00:23:00.290
And I believe it's something very important.

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:06.230
Wh-What was that?

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:08.480
A curious flavor.

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:11.880
Now there's something we're hiding together.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:14.120
So don't tell anyone.

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:16.120
I'm going to get some drinks.

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:19.410
It's true...

00:23:20.010 --> 00:23:23.570
I really do just go with the flow.

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:27.920
Wow, it's the school festival!

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:30.220
A romantic comedy unfolds between 
Gareth and an underclassman.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:31.230
I don't have feelings for her.

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:33.040
Oh, come on. That's rich coming from you.

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:33.880
Isn't it, Shirley?

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:35.400
Why me?!

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:37.030
Next time: "Festival."

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Holiday -Festival-</b>

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:39.320
If only things could stay this way forever...
